{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22044","main_id":22044,"main_title":"饰猫之法","main_description":"在浅濑神社工作的大岛纯平似乎正在为某事而发愁…","chapter_title":"饰猫之法","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2204401,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2204401,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":220440107,"next_line_ids":[220440108],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3182,"speaker_text_hash":2844979893,"speaker":"大岛纯平","speaker_raw":"大岛纯平","text_hash":3335993290,"text":"我之前看人做雕像的时候，除了制作雕像的本体，还会在雕像旁边搭配一些小装饰。","raw_text":"我之前看人做雕像的时候，除了制作雕像的本体，还会在雕像旁边搭配一些小装饰。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2204401.json"}
